data: {"id": "771a682af019412d-final", "run_id": "771a682af019412d", "seq": 1019, "ts_ms": 1789122800457, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload stuck in Pending/ContainerCreating state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod phase: `Pending`, status: `ContainerCreating` (app), restarts: `0` | 确证容器启动停滞，处于初始异常阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount` (x7 over 14m): `timed out waiting for the condition` | 指示挂载过程长期失败并超时 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount` (x16 over 16m): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` | 直接定位挂载失败的底层资源错误 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` = `1` (10:32:43Z) | 独立观测证实容器处于等待状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = `0` | 排除 CrashLoopBackOff 或频繁重启干扰 |\n\n**证据总结：**\nKubernetes Event 明确指出 `MountVolume.SetUp` 失败且错误详情为引用了不存在的 ConfigMap key（`unavailable-key`），这是导致挂载超时（Event #2）的直接原因。Metrics 数据（#4, #5）从时间序列上交叉验证了容器确实长期处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态且无重启，与事件发生的时间跨度一致。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 缺失 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 挂载体积 'input' 失败 → 触发 FailedMount 事件并进入挂载超时 → 容器 'app' 停滞在 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：Volume `input` 引用了 ConfigMap 中不存在的数据键 `unavailable-key`。\n\n该配置错误导致 `kubelet` 无法完成 `MountVolume.SetUp` 操作，进而引发了持续的 `FailedMount` 警告事件（证据 #2, #3）。由于挂载是容器启动的前置条件，Pod 被锁定在 `Pending` 状态（证据 #1），等待中的指标确认了这一状态长期存在（证据 #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 38.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 38.4s (Evidence 28.1s, RCA 10.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-config-error, pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 65.129, "metrics": {"run_id": "771a682af019412d", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 65.13283228874207, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 65132.832288742065, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 61683.51650238037, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 7777.251243591309, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3102.855682373047}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位